OL,3,AWork to replace old copper wiring
OL,4,Acaused nationwide ground stop, US
OL,5,Atransport secretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nationwide US ground stop that caused
OL,8,Fthousands of flight cancellations was
OL,9,Fcaused by an issue following a copper
OL,10,Fwire upgrade, Transport Secretary Sean
OL,11,FDuffy says
OL,13,FMore than 3,500 flights have been
OL,14,Fcancelled and more than 2,000 delayed
OL,15,Fin the US on Saturday, according to
OL,16,Ftracking website Flight Aware, as
OL,17,Fknock-on disruption continues
OL,19,FThe grounding began at around 16:00 EST
OL,20,F(21:00 GMT) on Friday and lasted more
OL,21,Fthan four hours - here's a timeline of
OL,22,Fhow it unfolded
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
